# Design System Updates

When adding or changing a reusable visual pattern, update the Design System docs.

Update `docs/design-system/README.md` and `docs/design-system/final-tokens.md` when changing:

- color, typography, spacing, radius, shadow, grid, or breakpoint usage;
- button, card, input, surface, or section pattern;
- animation timing, easing, reveal behavior, or motion convention;
- responsive rules that should be reused.

Update `src/data/design-system.md` only when the official source tokens or rules change.

Do not invent tokens silently. If a needed token is missing, document the recommendation before using a hardcoded value.
